### Module 3 — Selection of the final CDS sets

Galaxy wrapper for the structural CDS interpretation module of RECAP-PROK.

## Components

- Galaxy XML wrapper
- Snakemake execution
- CDS classification and interpretation
- GenBank export preparation

## Input

Genome annotation files (GFF/FASTA/GenBank)

## Output

- CDS comparison tables
- Structural classification results
- Module 4 preparation files
